---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Services — Zack Dell"
  description="Services: embedded C++ development, systems engineering, manufacturing automation, and electronics & firmware."
>
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:3rem">

    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">// SERVICES</span>
      <h2>What I offer</h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="services-list">
      <li class="reveal">
        <p class="service-index">01</p>
        <strong>Embedded C++ Development</strong>
        <p>Real-time, constrained systems: safe firmware, hardware integration, and sensor loops optimized for production environments.</p>
        <p class="service-caps">RTOS-minded · sensor loops · safe shutdown · power state FSM</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <p class="service-index">02</p>
        <strong>Systems Engineering</strong>
        <p>Requirements, architecture, test plans, and integration for robust production systems — from spec through verification.</p>
        <p class="service-caps">architecture docs · integration testing · DFM review · traceability</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <p class="service-index">03</p>
        <strong>Manufacturing Automation</strong>
        <p>Assembly-line control, motion control, real-time telemetry, and PLC-adjacent tooling for repeatable production processes.</p>
        <p class="service-caps">stepper control · closed-loop feedback · recipe management · SCADA-adjacent</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <p class="service-index">04</p>
        <strong>Electronics & Firmware</strong>
        <p>Multi-layer PCB design, schematic capture, component selection, DFM review, and firmware to bring hardware to life.</p>
        <p class="service-caps">KiCad · PMIC integration · multi-layer layout · Gerber-ready</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p style="margin-top:3rem;color:var(--muted)" class="reveal">
      Interested in working together? <a href="/contact">Send a message →</a>
    </p>

  </main>
</Base>
